      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The effect of nitroglycerin, beta-blockers, and calcium antagonists on the main parameters of central hemodynamics and myocardial metabolism is described. The original algorithm of the choice of the most effective drug or a combination of drugs depending on the initial state of central hemodynamics and coronary venous blood flow is presented."},
